      "content": "That's a good start, it sounds pretty natural. But looking at it now, I'm worried the score might be too low. I just checked a sample of a successful candidate's letter and they seemed to have these keywords mentioned way more frequently. \n\nCould you try another version? I really need that score to be as high as humanly possible to pass the filter. Like, if you can find ways to weave those words in more so they really pop for the scanner, go for it. Just try to keep it somewhat professional so it's not totally obvious. Can we push the density of those five words higher?",
